## Reactive Resume v5 API Reference
https://docs.rxresu.me/api-reference/resumes/create-a-new-resume
https://docs.rxresu.me/api-reference/resumes/patch-resume-data
https://docs.rxresu.me/api-reference/resume-export/export-resume-as-pdf

## Endpoints used:
POST https://rxresu.me/api/openapi/resumes
  → body: {name, slug, tags[], withSampleData}
  → returns: resume ID string

PATCH https://rxresu.me/api/openapi/resumes/{id}
  → body: {operations: [{op, path, value}]}
  → JSON Patch: replace /data/basics, /data/summary, /data/sections/...

GET https://rxresu.me/api/openapi/resume-export/{id}
  → returns: URL string of generated PDF

